	'k01696788' => 'Private Rooms',
	'k01bbc69c' => 'Here are answers to common questions about staying at Fumoto Hostel. If you need any further details before booking, our team is always pleased to help.',
	'k02fdeae5' => 'The Harbour Ward tram stop is located four minutes from our entrance, connecting you directly to the central train station, the historic dockyards, and the botanical quarter. Trams run frequently throughout the day and evening. Noor at the desk keeps a supply of transit schedules and can advise on the simplest tickets for single trips or multi-day travel across the city.',
	'k03f1a55e' => '6-bed mixed dorm',
	'k0421bbd7' => 'Booking',
	'k061f2d15' => 'We keep incidental costs straightforward and fair. A fresh morning breakfast is served in the dining room from 07:00 for €7. Secure personal lockers are free of charge for dormitory guests. Luggage storage is free both before check-in and after check-out between 07:00 and 23:00. Self-service laundry machines are available in the basement for €4 per cycle, including gentle laundry powder.',
