	'k1c591cb6' => 'Located at 14 Quay Lane, Harbour Ward, easily reached by local tram lines. Reception is open daily from 07:00 to 23:00, with check-in from 15:00 to 23:00 and check-out by 10:30.',
	'k1d363f51' => 'Tomasz Reid',
	'k1d3c9052' => 'Here, budget travel does not mean crowded chaos or overlooked details. Whether you are arriving from a long journey or exploring the harbour, you will always find an unhurried welcome, a peaceful kitchen, and spaces looked after with gentle precision.',
	'k1da478e7' => 'Founder &amp; Morning Desk',
	'k1dba46e1' => 'Tram Stop and Transit',
	'k1fe917b0' => 'FAQ',
	'k221e705c' => 'Your name',
	'k225e66a2' => 'The kitchen is open daily from 07:00 to 23:00, serving as the practical heart of the hostel. Fitted with generous prep counters, cooktops, refrigerators, and shelves of shared cookware, it lets you prepare your own meals whenever you like. A hearty breakfast is available each morning for €7, featuring fresh bread, preserves, and hot coffee. Every Wednesday at 19:00, Lucía Ferro hosts our shared supper around the central wooden table, bringing travellers together over simple, warm cooking.',
	'k2436434d' => 'Check-in begins at 15:00 at our front desk on Quay Lane. Ines or Tomasz will hand you your brass key, show you to your dorm or private room, and point out your locker and personal shelf. Drop your bags, wash off the journey, and make a pot of tea in the kitchen. If you arrive before 15:00, free luggage storage is available while you take a first stroll.',
	'k2706cf37' => 'Every bed booking at Fumoto Hostel includes full access to our shared facilities. Clean towels and linens are included in the nightly price, with no hidden cleaning surcharges. You will receive an individual locker key at check-in, and luggage storage is free before check-in from 07:00 and after check-out until 23:00. High-speed wireless internet reaches every room, and our communal kitchen is open daily from 07:00 to 23:00 for preparing meals.',
