	'k418c09e4' => 'Shared supper',
	'k4261f8e6' => 'View dorms →',
	'k436e7bec' => 'We believe in honest, predictable rates without hidden surcharges or surprises. All room rates include clean bed linen, bath towels, and full use of communal facilities.',
	'k45937326' => 'The Park and Neighbourhood Laundrette',
	'k45a04bce' => 'Self-service laundry facilities are open in the basement, with washers and dryers available for €4 per wash cycle including detergent. House rules are simple and designed for mutual consideration: please label your food in the kitchen, keep common surfaces clean after use, and respect quiet hours starting promptly at 23:00. Smoking is prohibited indoors, and we ask everyone to remove outdoor footwear at the entry hall to maintain clean wooden floors throughout.',
