	'k52de478d' => 'Book a bed',
	'k534d7b47' => 'When sending your enquiry, please let us know your planned arrival time so we can prepare your key. Because Fumoto Hostel is a calm house with only thirty-eight beds, we do not accept large party bookings or commercial group tours. Our quiet hours run from 23:00 to 07:00, ensuring all guests enjoy restful sleep. If you have specific arrival needs outside standard check-in hours, simply mention them in your message.',
	'k5405d8a9' => 'Frequently Asked Questions',
