	'k5a3cd11e' => 'Rates &amp; Terms',
	'k5c022472' => 'We follow a clear four-step process for all reservations. First, choose a bed that fits your trip: a 6-bed mixed dorm at €29, a 4-bed female dorm at €34, a twin private room at €78, or a double private en-suite room at €96. Second, send dates and guest details using our direct enquiry form. Third, receive confirmation within 12 hours from Noor. Fourth, pay at the desk on arrival.',
	'k5e706a9b' => 'Visit',
	'k5faabc39' => 'Beyond the kitchen, the common lounge provides comfortable armchairs, a communal library, and wide windows overlooking the lane. It is a peaceful place to read, write letters, or meet fellow travellers during the afternoon. Up top, our open-air roof terrace offers wooden benches and potted plants where guests can enjoy the harbour breeze and morning sun. To protect everyone\'s rest, the house observes quiet hours between 23:00 and 07:00 each evening.',
