	'k6dc30fcc' => 'Quiet hours begin promptly at 23:00 across all corridors and dormitories. Tomasz turns down the hallway lamps, leaving soft nightlights so late returners can easily find their bunks. The house sleeps quietly until morning. At 07:00, the kitchen reopens with optional breakfast for €7. Check-out is at 10:30, after which you are welcome to store your luggage with us until 23:00.',
	'k6e03eff5' => 'The House &amp; Spaces',
	'k735e4847' => 'House Amenities and Services',
