	'k748a46db' => 'See dorm rates →',
	'k7531d28f' => 'Dormitories',
	'k75a491fc' => 'A pleasant green park sits two blocks west, providing shady plane trees, quiet park benches, and views of the distant harbour water. It is a wonderful spot for a morning run or quiet reading in the sunshine. Around the corner, a local neighbourhood laundrette offers high-capacity washing equipment if you require an alternative to our €4 house laundry service on busy travel days.',
	'k764064be' => 'Neighbourhood Guide &amp; Bookings',
