	'k77ac1808' => 'The Market and Local Provisions',
	'k78386ec8' => 'People',
	'k7a35fa6a' => 'Yes, we offer a dedicated four-bed female dormitory priced at €34 per night. It features four sturdy bunks, individual reading lights, personal power outlets, secure lockers free of charge, and freshly washed linens and towels. It provides a peaceful, comfortable space for solo women travellers visiting Harbour Ward. Like all our rooms, it is thoroughly cleaned and aired each morning by Amara\'s housekeeping team.',
	'k7ee5e8f4' => 'Read night routine →',
	'k8047c44c' => 'Ines Marlow founded Fumoto Hostel in 2016 and keeps the front desk each morning from 07:00. She welcomes early arrivals, pours morning coffee, and offers quiet guidance for exploring Harbour Ward. When evening comes, Tomasz Reid takes over the night desk until 23:00, managing late check-ins, answering late-night travel enquiries, and ensuring the building stays quiet, warm, and secure after the city settles to sleep.',
	'k806a53c8' => 'Ines Marlow',
	'k83218ac3' => 'Welcome',
	'k832a8bc9' => 'Ines Marlow founded Fumoto in 2016 and keeps the morning desk with fresh coffee and neighbourhood advice. Tomasz Reid watches over the reception through the evening and night to ensure late arrivals find a warm welcome. Amara Osei leads daily housekeeping, keeping every dorm bunk and private room spotless and serene.',
	'k85207835' => 'Kenji Arden oversees maintenance throughout the house, keeping window latches smooth, plumbing reliable, and wooden furniture in good repair across every floor. Noor Haddad manages bookings, answers reservation enquiries, and curates our neighbourhood guide. Having walked every corner of Harbour Ward, Noor is always happy to recommend quiet tram stops, local produce markets, and pleasant coastal paths.',
	'k8572c9c6' => '€4 per load',
	'k85a2dbf3' => 'Market, tram, park and laundrette are all closer than the end of Quay Lane suggests.',
	'k85d924ee' => 'Founder, keeps the front desk each morning.',
	'k8828ee0c' => 'Our communal spaces are made for morning coffee, simple meals, and quiet conversation by the window. The shared kitchen is open daily from 07:00 to 23:00, self-service laundry is available for €4, and quiet hours begin at 23:00 so every guest rests easily.',
	'k89faa0f2' => 'We offer free cancellation up to 48 hours prior to your scheduled check-in time of 15:00 on your arrival date. If you need to cancel or modify your travel dates, simply send an email to Noor or reply directly to your booking confirmation note. Cancellations received within 48 hours of arrival, or failure to arrive at the hostel, will be charged for the first night of the stay.',
