	'k8e78c73d' => 'Dormitory Beds',
	'k91510c33' => 'Fumoto Hostel occupies a bright building on Quay Lane arranged around shared spaces that welcome conversation or quiet focus. Here, everyday domestic routines unfold with calm simplicity.',
	'k9247f52b' => 'A Night at Fumoto',
	'k957b78e5' => 'Standard check-in begins at 15:00 and runs until 23:00 at our front desk. If you arrive earlier in the day, you are warmly invited to leave your bags in our luggage room free of charge and explore Harbour Ward. Check-out is by 10:30 on the morning of departure so Amara\'s housekeeping team can clean rooms and prepare fresh linens for incoming guests.',
	'k95c66b91' => 'What is your cancellation policy?',
	'k964cddb8' => 'Meet our team →',
	'k990509ac' => 'Yes, luggage storage is completely free for all guests on their arrival and departure dates. Our secure luggage room is accessible during full reception hours from 07:00 until 23:00. Simply speak with Ines or Tomasz at the front desk, set your bags inside, and spend your remaining hours visiting the neighbourhood market or walking along the harbour without carrying heavy bags.',
	'k994f8045' => 'Quiet hours run strictly between 23:00 and 07:00 each night across all corridors and dormitories. During this time, we ask all guests to speak in low whispers, dim bedroom lights, and avoid taking phone calls in sleeping quarters and hallways. Tomasz monitors the house overnight to ensure everyone enjoys undisturbed rest. The common lounge remains open for quiet night-time reading under soft lamps.',
	'k9b0c2996' => 'Yes, all thirty-eight beds in our house include freshly laundered bed linen and a clean bath towel at no additional cost. We provide soft cotton sheets, warm duvets, and comfortable pillows for every guest. If you are staying for multiple nights and would like a fresh towel during your visit, simply ask at the reception desk and our housekeeping team will gladly provide one for you.',
	'k9b893879' => 'Quiet twin and double bedrooms with tranquil views over the street and courtyard. Featuring comfortable mattresses, dedicated work desks, and en-suite or shared bathrooms, starting from €78 per night.',
