	'kb399a707' => 'Since 2016, our small team has cared for Fumoto Hostel with steady attention and honest hospitality. We live in Harbour Ward and look after every guest by name.',
	'kb6645a5b' => 'Reservations may be cancelled free of charge up to 48 hours prior to your scheduled arrival date. Cancellations made within 48 hours, or no-shows, will incur a fee equal to the first night\'s stay. Payment is taken at the front desk upon arrival; we gladly accept debit cards, major credit cards, and cash. There are no prepayment requirements or non-refundable booking deposit fees.',
	'kb846b14f' => 'Locker',
	'kb8bf380d' => 'During a quiet Wednesday in autumn, a solitary architecture student from the twin private room sat beside an engineer in the 4-bed female dorm at Lucía\'s shared supper. Neither knew anyone in the city when they pulled up their chairs at 19:00. By the time bread was passed and soup bowls were cleared, they had discovered shared transit routes and spent the following two days exploring the local market together.',
