	'kbf3a23aa' => 'When a delayed regional train arrived past midnight, a tired traveller walked up Quay Lane worried she had lost her reservation. Instead, Tomasz was waiting at the night desk with warm tea, the entrance light on, and a brass key laid out on the wooden counter beside her confirmation slip. She slipped into a prepared bunk, slept uninterrupted, and woke to sunlight streaming across our quiet kitchen.',
