	'kce8ae9da' => 'Email',
	'kd06960f5' => 'Harbour Ward is a pedestrian-friendly district with quiet side streets and dedicated cycle lanes leading from the waterfront. Guests arriving by bicycle may park securely in our rear interior courtyard overnight free of charge. If you arrive on foot before check-in opens at 15:00, drop your rucksack in our luggage room and enjoy a stroll through the local market.',
