	'kdf2d5f57' => 'Step directly onto Quay Lane into quiet morning streets, local markets, and nearby tram stops just minutes from our door.',
	'ke029e0ea' => 'Our reception desk is staffed daily between 07:00 and 23:00 to assist with arrivals, keys, and city advice. If you have questions before arriving or wish to inquire about availability for specific dates, send us a message through our booking enquiry form. Noor responds to all reservation emails within 12 hours. For urgent same-day arrival updates, reach Tomasz at the desk before 23:00.',
