	'ke3406f9a' => 'Per night, includes fresh bed linen and towel',
	'ke52bb1e5' => 'Enjoy morning coffee, pack at an easy pace, and leave your luggage with us.',
	'ke5aac4a0' => 'Our front desk is staffed daily from 07:00 to 23:00. Ines manages morning arrivals starting from 07:00, while Tomasz oversees the desk through the evening until 23:00. If your train or evening journey is delayed past 23:00, please notify our team in advance. We will make arrangements for building access and ensure your room key is safely prepared for your late arrival at the counter.',
	'ke7479a1e' => 'Shared supper takes place every Wednesday evening at 19:00 around the long table in our communal kitchen. Hosted by Lucía Ferro, it brings travellers together over a warm, home-cooked meal prepared with ingredients from the Harbour Ward market. All resident guests are welcome to pull up a chair, share travel stories, and meet fellow visitors in a relaxed and friendly atmosphere.',
	'ke78a608f' => 'Booking a stay at Fumoto Hostel is simple, direct, and handled personally by our desk team. We respond to all reservation enquiries within twelve hours.',
	'ke7f49c1e' => 'Housekeeping Lead',
