	'kecdb154e' => 'Twin private',
	'ked20f31f' => 'For guests seeking quieter personal quarters, we offer two styles of private rooms. The twin private room with shared bathroom facilities is €78 per night, providing two single beds with light oak frames and fresh cotton bedding. The double private room with an en-suite bathroom is €96 per night, featuring a comfortable double mattress and private shower. Both private room options include towels, linens, warm daylight, and a quiet desk space for writing or planning your onward journey.',
	'ked8968b4' => 'Noor Haddad',
	'keddf0509' => 'A touring cyclist arrived at 14 Quay Lane on a rainy Tuesday evening, intending to sleep a single night in our 6-bed dorm before pedalling north. But after drying his panniers by the radiator, sharing coffee with Ines, and fixing a slipped chain with Kenji\'s workshop tools, he extended his stay day after day. He spent his extra days reading in the lounge and exploring the Harbour Ward park, leaving on Saturday fully rested.',
