	'kf9d74ca8' => 'Finding 14 Quay Lane',
	'kfb103c79' => 'Amara Osei leads our housekeeping team, inspecting every room daily and ensuring all thirty-eight beds are dressed in freshly washed linen and clean towels. In the kitchen, Lucía Ferro manages shared supplies, prepares morning breakfast, and cooks our Wednesday shared supper at 19:00. Her suppers are known for turning solitary travellers into good friends around the long oak table.',
